{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act39side_level_act39side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act39side",
  "stageId": "act39side_06",
  "title": "若退路在燃烧",
  "storyCode": "EP-6",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3d72915ad7651ad48c5673580e4d8b2c7918cdab1d23348b568fb4808e4381eb",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g2_saltdesert_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）难以置信，那女人竟然愿意放我们离开......本来以为修复失败后，我们都会被五花大绑交给审判庭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）嘘......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，无论说多少次抱歉，都挽回不了你的损失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想这就是结局了，伊西多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安心吧，我不会怪你，这不是你的错。做下选择的时候，我就已经接受了结果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，是你为我们承受了船员们的愤怒，也是你保下了帕斯卡拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......或许你也可以和我们一起走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可以预见，女士，留在这里你会非常危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快走吧。你们之前不是吵着要跑吗？现在有机会了，怎么还不动身？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是船队的首领，我不会抛下我的船员。这是我向科鲁兹立下的誓言，这一辈子我都不会违背它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "胡安娜女士，有样东西......我得还给你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那身衣服和剑你留着吧，就当是给你的酬劳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是那些......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "青年将手伸进衣袋，却突然停住了。他缓缓地吐了口气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "然后取出了兜里的物件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗盘？不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......我不明白，如果它还安然无恙，那炼金工坊里那些残骸是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你没在修复罗盘，那这段时间你到底在做什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说话啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "实验里毁掉的那个罗盘......是我尝试着复制出来的。真品......我没动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？！我怎么不知道......什么时候的事情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没告诉任何人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不明白，你这么做的理由是什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗盘上搭载的心相原质......结构远比我想象的复杂。如果我不能完美地将它复制出来，那说明我很可能仍然没能理解它的本质。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种情况下贸然去操作真正的心相原质，几乎只可能失败。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我不能失败。你的期望，整支船队的关注，极境和帕斯卡拉的命运......都在我身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "后来，我总忍不住去想，如果注定失败，至少我该有办法把损失降到最低。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我一直在试图复制心相原质。假如事实证明我没有能力理解心相原质，你们至少还可以带着真品，去找下一位炼金术师。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还省出了一部分材料，不至于让船队弹尽粮绝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对不起，我确实想尽了办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊西多......你觉得这样就算是尽了全力吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我算过，失败的概率超过百分之八十七......这是我能想到的最保险的办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "失败并不足以让人畏惧，纵然成功的几率只有万分之一，我也会孤注一掷，倾尽所有去赌一个机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是赌博，不是实验。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......比起成功的概率，我们拥有第二次机会的概率才更为渺茫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告诉我，我们的人生到底是赌博，还是实验？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "温蒂一会儿会来接我离开，你打算和我们一起走吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我的旅途还没有结束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会继续下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你呢，帕斯卡拉？和我一起走吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧，至少我能想办法带你离开这里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好......伊西多，你保重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "极境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，你们也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g14_ibtown_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "西尔弗阁下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你愿意留下，这很好，很好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您忘了？我腿一直不利索，去不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我没忘。你是之前第二次围剿的时候受的伤吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......您就是忘了。我这腿伤是行刑那天落下的，当初是您给我处理的伤口。结果伤口最后还是感染了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假如，我是说假如......我当初医术没有这么差，治好了你的腿。你现在会和我们一起去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你和他说了什么？我们该出发了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安纳斯塔西奥先生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很荣幸与您共事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g10_community_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1580_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夫人，您去哪里了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......才去把那几个小家伙送出去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1580_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您吩咐的事情我都已经准备好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这几天，你......先带着手下和宝宝在盐漠里躲一躲吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1580_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不会留您一个人在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是命令，蒂奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g2_saltdesert_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "月色下，伊西多一个人踩在盐漠上，背后一串孤独的脚印跟随着他。\n他不知道自己走了多久，大概有整整一夜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g21_skystarry_r2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他觉得自己好像让很多人失望了，但又不清楚自己到底做错了什么。\n忽然间，他想有个朋友在身边，又猛地意识到他与极境才刚刚道别。\n伊西多猜想，温蒂应该已经找到了极境，确认自己的安全后，他们的任务也就结束了。\n或许此刻他们正商量着离开盐漠，继续下一个任务。而他也会继续自己的旅程，一个人。\n没什么不好，没牵也没挂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g10_community_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "困倦的船员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1592_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "困倦的船员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1592_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早知道晚上不多喝那两盆咸鳞汁了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "困倦的船员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1592_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷酷的习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "守卫已经解决，告知执裁官阁下，信息无误。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷酷的习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "准备向前推进。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g11_meetingroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的动作很快，哈维尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......只有你一个人，女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如你所见，是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你身边不该连一个护卫的人都没有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "或许，那个本该护卫我的人就在这里......\n就在这里，拿一把我为他打造的刀，指着我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在，如你所愿，杀了我，整支船队由你接管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "胡安娜已经就擒，看好她，别伤了她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真是可笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g10_community_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的船员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1592_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们是怎么找来的？......是哪个鳞屎喂大的混账背叛了我们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "死到临头还想着寻仇，恶徒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愤怒的船员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1592_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如何，问出罗盘的线索了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "执裁官大人，这都只是些喽啰，话都说不利索的那种。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要找到罗盘，我们还需再深入这伙强盗的据点......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有我的指令不要停下来，沿途的一切焚烧干净。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些用来作孽的肮脏之物，没有留存的价值。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g2_saltdesert_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "异常的声响将伊西多扯出他的思绪，唤停了他的脚步。\n转过头，他看见远处有什么东西朦朦胧胧地照亮了黑夜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那是冲天的火光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那是船队的方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么会这样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1577_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "伊西多毫不犹豫地迈出了步子。\n不靠理性，只凭冲动，他做出了决定。\n沿着来时踩出的脚印，伊西多拼命地往回奔去。\n那串脚印于是不再孤独。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g11_meetingroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别再找了，你找不到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "船员们告诉我，那小子的实验搞砸了，罗盘毁在他手里。你就算找到，也没用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗盘对我有没有用，不是你能说的，强盗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是是......对不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我守了那罗盘将近十年，我杀了每一个试图染指它的人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算它真的化为齑粉，我也要亲眼见证。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们的首领在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们有过协议，你们会放过胡安娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你和西尔弗的协议，与我无关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个女人带着罗盘逃走了，是不是？那套炼金失败的说法只是借口，是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谎言......为了保护那个女人，为了你自己的欲望，是不是？你也该被——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没骗你。罗盘早就不在胡安娜手上了，她要一只已经毁掉的罗盘毫无意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你该找的只有那个炼金小子和他的工坊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那边后排的第二个帐篷，地上有暗门，炼金工坊就在那底下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......谎言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别逼我现在杀了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "57_g9_community_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老实点！别乱动！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窘迫的船员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个......你们说的是真的吗？只要找到那枚罗盘，我们都能获得赦免？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窘迫的船员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鉴于我们投降得这么快......我们的赦免是不是也应该适当放宽些条件？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蠢货。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "窘迫的船员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
